                          "name": "DS/Game Tile",
                          "context": "Each Home game owns one different creature in every theme, locale and device. A skeleton, jaw, silhouette or colouring still counts as the same species: never reuse it for another game. COMPARE — Tyrannosaurus; EXPLORE — Stegosaurus; PAIRS — Triceratops; BONES — Brachiosaurus skeleton; DIG — Therizinosaurus; SORT — Pachycephalosaurus (full colour, never silhouette); CARE — Oviraptor; DRAW — Parasaurolophus; MAZE — Ankylosaurus; PUZZLE — Spinosaurus; TEETH — Baryonyx; COLOR — Mosasaurus. SOON has no creature. Reserve a new unused species for each new game. NEWNESS · Use a reward-colour 24 px sparkle disc on the top-leading pocket rim, x4 / y−8, keeping the creature clear. No visible NEW or НОВОЕ text. Add New game / Новая игра to the card accessible name; the marker is decorative. The placement is identical in every locale and device.",
