          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Adds the reverse questions WHO IS LIGHTER? (feather) and WHO IS SHORTER? (arrow down). The pick that wins is the smaller one, and the ✓ and ✗ marks work the same way.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Wkk2u",
          "name": "The reveal · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Answer and last question",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Kmvtc",
          "name": "The reveal · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A right pick gets ✓ and NEXT. A wrong pick gets ✗, the right card gets ✓, and that step on the progress bar turns red. On question 10, SEE RESULT with a trophy takes the place of NEXT.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ysw6Y",
          "name": "FIELD GUIDE · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Loading and result",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rXqIN",
          "name": "FIELD GUIDE · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The progress shows at once and the pictures shimmer until they load; the values and NEXT appear only after a pick. The result shows the level switch with the round's level chosen. A first best (4 on a new level) is celebrated as FIRST BEST!. Switching level leaves the result and starts no round.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WtjRR",
          "name": "Motion · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Motion",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gcXPO",
          "name": "Motion · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A new question slides the two cards in from the sides and VS pops between them. A pick presses the card in, then ✓ or ✗ pops on it and the values fade in; that step on the progress bar fills, green or red. NEXT slides the pair out and the next pair in. The result's FIRST BEST! or NEW BEST! bounces once with a burst of stars, and a level switch slides its highlight. Reduced motion turns each into a short fade.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QXDGV",
          "name": "Dark · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every device, dark and Russian",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NHpNg",
          "name": "Dark · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each new question kind is drawn on the iPad on its side, the iPad upright, the iPhone, the iPhone on its side and the iPhone SE, with dark and Russian frames. In Russian, VS reads ИЛИ, NEXT reads ДАЛЬШЕ, SEE RESULT reads РЕЗУЛЬТАТ, FIRST BEST! reads ПЕРВЫЙ РЕКОРД!, and values use a decimal comma: 3,1 М. On the iPad upright the bar's steps narrow to fit ДОМОЙ and 10 / 10.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
