    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "WcoIi",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 25717,
      "name": "TEETH · levels · how it plays",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light",
        "device": "phone"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 700,
      "fill": "$ds-sky-bottom",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "K7I8g",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOW WHOSE JAW? PLAYS AT EACH LEVEL",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "irBSe",
          "name": "Welcome · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Welcome",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EXeTS",
          "name": "Welcome · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The tooth title, the gummy dinosaur with its jaw, the level switch, a tooth best badge (absent on a first visit) and the shelf count out of 16. PLAY and JAW SHELF are the actions; HOME is in the top bar.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "m1gHa",
          "name": "The board · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The board",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jpagv",
          "name": "The board · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Five tooth sockets show the round. A socket fills as a jaw is placed and shines when that jaw needed no wrong try. The jaw waits in the sand tray, at least 160 pt wide.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Haz3U",
          "name": "Hatchling · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Hatchling",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZiBAS",
          "name": "Hatchling · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Two dinosaurs, one meat eater and one plant eater, each with its food beside it. A wrong pick gets OW! SHARP TEETH! or HMM? FLAT TEETH! and the jaw goes back to the tray. After two wrong tries the owner glows and the tray shows the jaw's food.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Z2zqT",
          "name": "Explorer · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Explorer",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vyMvM",
          "name": "Explorer · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Three dinosaurs without food labels. Lifting the jaw glows it and outlines every mouth; dragging tilts the dinosaur under it. A right pick shows the real dinosaur, dims the others and puts NEXT in the tray.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NMmbj",
          "name": "Paleontologist · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Paleontologist",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kx1Q5",
          "name": "Paleontologist · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Four look-alike pairs with large names. Giving the jaw to its partner shows a ruler shape cue (MY TEETH ARE THIN LIKE KNIVES!). The right owner shows the jaw's fact beside NEXT.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "x7zax",
          "name": "Result · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Result",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "piLN3",
          "name": "Result · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One to three stars (no wrong tries: 3, one: 2, more: 1), the pile of five placed jaws, the level's best with FIRST BEST! or NEW BEST!, and new finds flying onto a small shelf. PLAY AGAIN, JAW SHELF, HOME. A strong round can end with the level offer after the rewards.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kdUty",
          "name": "Jaw shelf · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Jaw shelf",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "p8ONMI",
          "name": "Jaw shelf · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Four rows of four: plant eaters first, row 2 mixed with both labels, then meat eaters. A won place shows its jaw and name; an unwon one a faint jaw and ?. A won jaw opens its card: gummy dinosaur, jaw, name, food, fact, BACK. On iPhone the long names split at a syllable.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "A4tFuv",
          "name": "Motion · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Motion",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ONVAe",
          "name": "Motion · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The lifted jaw glows and follows the finger; the dinosaur under it tilts toward it. A right drop snaps the jaw into the mouth and its socket fills with a shine. A wrong drop wiggles the dinosaur and the jaw glides back to the tray. The result's stars pop in one by one, new jaws fly onto the small shelf, and the level offer rises over a scrim. Reduced motion turns each into a short fade, and the jaw goes back to the tray without gliding.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kfuAi",
          "name": "Every device, dark and Russian · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every device, dark and Russian",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VOtYg",
          "name": "Every device, dark and Russian · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Boards are drawn for the iPad mini on its side and upright, the iPhone, the iPhone SE (fits without scrolling) and the iPhone on its side, plus dark and Russian versions. Loading pictures shimmer in their own places.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tJTm6",
          "name": "Art to fix · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Art to fix",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "k6JOY8",
          "name": "Art to fix · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "13 of the 16 jaw pictures have an opaque white background, so in dark mode they sit on white blocks. They need transparent backgrounds like the Tyrannosaurus, Allosaurus and Velociraptor jaws.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "a9W8d",
      "x": 7700,
      "y": 2050,
