    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "RQz8Z",
      "x": 7500,
      "y": 36500,
      "name": "SORT · levels · how it plays",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light",
        "device": "phone"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "$ds-sky-bottom",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Zyhe1",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOW SORT PLAYS AT EACH LEVEL",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "q4VGQ3",
          "name": "Board · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Board",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "T5hn0a",
          "name": "Board · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "No welcome screen: SORT starts a round at once. The top bar has HOME (the house alone on phones), the steps (one mark per card, a sorted card fills its mark green, no numbers) and nothing else. The prompt SORT THEM ALL / РАЗЛОЖИ ВСЕХ sits beside the shapes symbol. The tray holds the cards still to sort; a sorted card leaves an empty pocket behind.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "SJ2cm",
          "name": "Levels · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Levels",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jckNR",
          "name": "Levels · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Hatchling: 6 cards, 2 baskets, by legs, diet, size, horns or feathers. Explorer: 8 cards; diet adds a third basket BOTH / ВСЁ (Gallimimus, Oviraptor). Paleontologist: 10 cards; legs adds TWO OR FOUR / ДВЕ ИЛИ ЧЕТЫРЕ (Iguanodon, Parasaurolophus, Edmontosaurus), feathers adds NOT KNOWN YET / ПОКА НЕИЗВЕСТНО.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "b7dcC1",
          "name": "Basket marks · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Basket marks",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LM4A8",
          "name": "Basket marks · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every basket shows its mark: 2 or 4 with footprints, 2 4 for either; a leaf, a drumstick, both for BOTH; a big or a small footprint; a horn, a crossed horn; a feather, a crossed feather, a feather with ?. Phones show the mark alone, 44 tall; the name stays for screen readers.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "CZ5yP",
          "name": "Play · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Play",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QMBgf",
          "name": "Play · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Drag a card over a basket: the basket lights with an orange outline and the card lifts and tilts. Or tap a card to pick it up (orange outline, raised), then tap a basket. A right drop lands with a green ✓ and fills a step. A wrong drop slides the card back; it then shows its right basket's mark as a yellow hint and the right basket glows yellow. After the last card the tray shows SEE RESULT / РЕЗУЛЬТАТ with a trophy.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JSqIM",
          "name": "Full baskets · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Full baskets",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "V7pkO",
          "name": "Full baskets · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A basket's cards wrap into rows. It picks the columns with the largest pictures where every name fits on one line at 14px over at least 48px of picture; if none fits, all its name strips hide and the pictures take the room. A long name on the tray shrinks to fit its card on one line.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FIgHQ",
          "name": "Pictures · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Pictures",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fCNj9",
          "name": "Pictures · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A loading picture shimmers at its size, its name below. A picture that fails shows footprints, its name still below.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "w1YIDw",
          "name": "Result · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Result",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "kX8Nt",
          "name": "Result · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The compare quiz's result: n / 6, 8 or 10 with that many stars, the right ones won; WELL DONE!; FIRST BEST!, NEW BEST! (celebrated) or BEST (no celebration, also for a first round of 0). The level switch, then PLAY AGAIN and HOME. Phones: the level switch as pictures alone, PLAY AGAIN over HOME.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Krbqx",
          "name": "Sizes · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Sizes",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "y1On2E",
          "name": "Sizes · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "iPad upright: tray 2 rows of 3 at 200, 4 at 158, 5 at 123; baskets side by side, mark above name, one name size per window from the longest word in either language (at most 34, 28 for three baskets, never under 16). Phone: tray 2×3 at 112, 2×4 or 3×4 at 82, baskets 8 apart, never under 72 wide; the iPhone SE Paleontologist board scrolls.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
