    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "LthXW",
      "x": 9900,
      "y": 64600,
      "name": "MAZE · how it plays",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light",
        "device": "phone"
      },
      "clip": true,
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "$ds-sky-bottom",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AfLKg",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "HOW MAZE PLAYS",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "V96Mry",
          "name": "Levels · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Levels",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Xzkok",
          "name": "Levels · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Hatchling 9×7, Explorer 15×9, Paleontologist 17×11, all with real mazes from the game's generator. Hatchling's bar shows the route mark and LABYRINTH; Explorer and Paleontologist show the level picture and name. The shared level switch sits above AGAIN on the result.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zODE9",
          "name": "Board · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Board",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TfFZt",
          "name": "Board · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tunnels dug into the earth: open cells are light sand, walls are packed earth, with no lines between tunnel cells. Every cell is at least 48 points on every device. No timer.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C4Hmkf",
          "name": "Steps · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Steps",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KJ3fi",
          "name": "Steps · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every legal next cell shows footprints on a pale spot with a terracotta ring, all alike. Tap one, or use the arrow keys. A tap on earth or on a cell further away does nothing. The baby slides one cell and the new footprints fade in.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "z2cTBc",
          "name": "Hint · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Hint",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IcYep",
          "name": "Hint · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HINT turns amber while its hint shows. Only the next cell on the way home glows amber with sparkles. The glow clears on the next step.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JVQYm",
          "name": "Home · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Home",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Q02g7a",
          "name": "Home · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Hatchling: a house marks the goal cell, and the parent waits beside the maze with BRING THE BABY HOME. Explorer and Paleontologist: the parent picture with a house badge stands on the goal cell. Suggestion: on an iPad held sideways a smaller parent reminder still sits beside the maze.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "g9gfFy",
          "name": "Arrival · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Arrival",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ixC5w",
          "name": "Arrival · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The baby steps onto the goal: the cell glows amber with baby and parent together, the words become HOME TOGETHER!, then the result follows.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UpmW1",
          "name": "Result · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Result",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "SdC0k",
          "name": "Result · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Baby and parent together, with a heart. HOME TOGETHER!, all three stars every time, and +3 STARS · TOTAL n (only +3 STARS when progress can't be read). The first round at a level shows FIRST BEST! 3 with confetti. Every later round ties: BEST 3/3, no celebration. A round scores 3 every time, so a higher best can't happen. Then AGAIN and HOME.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MK5Hi",
          "name": "Level offer · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Level offer",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zUG1v",
          "name": "Level offer · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "After three hint-free rounds at a lower level, or the fifth after a decline: a scrim and the offer card. Phones stack NOT NOW over YES.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "L3cCYG",
          "name": "Portrait and phones · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Portrait and phones",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ruyFH",
          "name": "Portrait and phones · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Suggestion: the upright iPad turns the maze on its side, so each level fits whole at 48 points or more. iPhone and SE: Hatchling turned upright fits whole. Explorer and Paleontologist keep their rows and scroll sideways, following the baby. Edges fade where more maze lies. When home is out of view, a parent marker on that edge points to it. On its side, the maze scrolls with the parent and the guidance beside it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PHRkL",
          "name": "Keyboard · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Keyboard",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "h7Adh5",
          "name": "Keyboard · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Arrow keys step. A thick navy ring marks the focused maze.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vUha8",
          "name": "Pictures · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Pictures",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LsuZD",
          "name": "Pictures · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The board plays at once. The baby and parent shimmer until their pictures arrive.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "j1Qnd3",
          "name": "Dark · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Dark",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vA9NO",
          "name": "Dark · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tunnels stay lighter than the earth. Footprint spots turn navy with the terracotta ring, and the hint stays amber.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O07tSX",
          "name": "Motion · head",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Motion",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tXL8h",
          "name": "Motion · body",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Shared motion tokens: the board rises in, the baby slides each step, footprints fade in and the hint glow pulses softly. The reunion cell glows, stars pop one by one, and confetti plays only for a first best. Reduced motion uses short fades.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
