          "id": "FUOU0",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "COLOR · how it plays",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "CUpbX",
          "name": "Head · Three screens",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Three screens",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NFUvj",
          "name": "Body · Three screens",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "MY ART gallery, the workshop and the result. HOME is always top-left; the ★ chip top-right counts completed works. Every change between them uses the shared motion tokens and falls back to short fades under reduced motion.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "B1qi0B",
          "name": "Head · Age levels",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Age levels",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yuIXg",
          "name": "Body · Age levels",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Hatchling paints the simple drawings with big regions. Explorer and Paleontologist paint the rich scenes with sun, plants and ground. Switching level changes only new works; every saved drawing keeps its own artwork.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZEDOg",
          "name": "Head · Gallery",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Gallery",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lFgaX",
          "name": "Body · Gallery",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One NEW start per dinosaur, with its blank drawing and name. Works below, newest first: the latest one carries CONTINUE, the others PAINT, or VIEW when read-only. A badge marks each work: a dashed circle for a draft, a star for a completed work, a warning for one that couldn't open (RETRY). The first visit shows an arrow up to the starts and LET'S PAINT A DINOSAUR!. An untouched new work never appears.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TTXZH",
          "name": "Head · Workshop on every device",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Workshop on every device",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wE9ce",
          "name": "Body · Workshop on every device",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Landscape iPad: a leading rail (HOME, NEW, GALLERY, DONE, then BRUSH, FILL, COLOR, SIZE, UNDO) beside a full-height paper. Upright iPad: one top row (HOME, NEW, GALLERY · BRUSH, FILL, SIZE, UNDO · DONE), the paper, and all twelve colors always open underneath, so there is no COLOR button. Phones: navigation on top, the paper, a tools bar of five underneath. Phone on its side: the same as pills, with the word beside the symbol. A chosen tool shows a green check. DONE and UNDO are unavailable while the work is empty, including when only the base color has been used.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fuRMM",
          "name": "Head · Pickers",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Pickers",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "A5L7tf",
          "name": "Body · Pickers",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Landscape iPad: COLOR and SIZE open a popover beside the rail; the drawing stays where it is. Upright iPad: colors need no picker; SIZE opens a popover under its button, clear of the save pill. Phones: a chooser sheet replaces the paper until a choice, CLOSE or Escape. Twelve colors with their names, three sizes; choosing a size selects BRUSH. Long Russian names stay on one line: the phone sheet narrows its side padding.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UErFg",
          "name": "Head · Saving",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Saving",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ibCNy",
          "name": "Body · Saving",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each change saves on its own. The pill on the paper says SAVING, then SAVED; SAVED is never shown before the save succeeds. On failure it turns into COULDN'T SAVE with RETRY and stays until a save succeeds. Leaving with a pending or failed save opens the save-error panel (RETRY, KEEP EDITING, HOME WITHOUT SAVING); HOME WITHOUT SAVING asks once more (STAY, LEAVE).",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "g9yUqT",
          "name": "Head · Reward",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Reward",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "otAdM",
          "name": "Body · Reward",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "DONE on a nonempty work shows it coming alive with confetti and sparkles. The first completion of a work earns +1 STAR, grows the collection and celebrates FIRST BEST (collection 1) or NEW BEST. Finishing the same work again shows YOUR STAR with no new celebration. No grade for accuracy, coverage or speed. EDIT, GALLERY and NEW WORK lead on; if the work can't open, a pill asks to EDIT again.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "esDIz",
          "name": "Head · Storage trouble",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Storage trouble",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "E2ynQD",
          "name": "Body · Storage trouble",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Unreadable storage keeps readable works visible, view-only, with a warning bar and RETRY. When RETRY cannot help, PARENT RECOVERY opens a parent warning in normal case: RESET COLORING loses all coloring works and stars; CANCEL changes nothing.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d5f8kL",
          "name": "Head · Dark and Russian",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Dark and Russian",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NELZU",
          "name": "Body · Dark and Russian",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Dark theme dims the paper so the drawing's cream background still reads as paper. Russian titles name the dinosaur (ТВОЙ ТРИЦЕРАТОПС!); on phones the result chips take a row each.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
