    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "BXcVH",
      "x": 6265,
      "y": 94200,
      "name": "DRAW · how it plays",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "light",
        "device": "phone"
      },
      "width": 560,
      "fill": "$ds-sky-bottom",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ZL5pu",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "DRAW · how it plays",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 28,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sDmoN",
          "name": "Head · The sand",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "The sand",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "asljs",
          "name": "Body · The sand",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The whole screen is sand, behind the controls too, and nothing scrolls. No title, no rules, no score, no timer: the child writes letters, numbers and figures, and every mark stays exactly as drawn; nothing is recognised or tidied up. It is the same at every age level.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FjiDl",
          "name": "Head · HOME and STICK",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "HOME and STICK",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "K5vX9s",
          "name": "Body · HOME and STICK",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOME at the leading edge and STICK at the trailing edge, both at the top inside the safe area, each a round button with its word under it. STICK shows the chosen tip as a line of that width; the child starts with MEDIUM.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n4WNgc",
          "name": "Head · The picker",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "The picker",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "UPlU3",
          "name": "Body · The picker",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "STICK opens a small panel under it: THIN, MEDIUM and THICK as lines 2, 4 and 8 points wide, the chosen one navy with a tick, and CLEAR under a rule. Choosing a tip closes the panel and changes only the strokes after it. CLEAR smooths the sand at once and keeps the tip. Opening the panel or pressing HOME leaves no mark.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MJbFO",
          "name": "Head · A groove",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "A groove",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tBe2M",
          "name": "Body · A groove",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A stroke is a continuous rounded groove, darker than the sand, with a light lip of pushed-up sand to its lower right. At night the sand and the groove darken and the lip is faint. A tip is the same width in points on every device.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "o9yZOG",
          "name": "Head · Turning and resizing",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Turning and resizing",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "h1Td4",
          "name": "Body · Turning and resizing",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every mark keeps its place from the top-left corner. Marks past a new edge are hidden, not wiped, and come back on turning back. HOME and STICK stay in their corners and new strokes keep the chosen tip.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jwyXQ",
          "name": "Head · One finger",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "One finger",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WGNbk",
          "name": "Body · One finger",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Only the first finger draws; a second finger, a pinch or a long hold does nothing. A stroke begun within half a second and 100 points of a tap is ignored, so a double tap leaves no dot.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O9WI3",
          "name": "Head · Motion",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Motion",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Zv1QL",
          "name": "Body · Motion",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "DRAW opens with the shared screen transition. The panel drops from STICK with a quick scale and fade and closes the same way; the tick pops onto the new tip; CLEAR fades the marks out quickly. With reduced motion every change is a short fade.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "V68Fn0",
          "name": "Head · Leaving",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Leaving",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "f0dkQi",
          "name": "Body · Leaving",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOME goes back to Home. Opening DRAW again starts with fresh sand and MEDIUM.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gO1yw",
          "name": "Head · Tokens",
          "fill": "$ds-ink",
          "content": "Tokens",
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DIFha",
          "name": "Body · Tokens",
          "fill": "$ds-ink-soft",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "New: ds-groove and ds-groove-lip for the marks, ds-sand-glow for the light in the middle of the sand, ds-speck for its grain; each has a dark value. The controls reuse ds-label, ds-strong, ds-quiet, ds-good and ds-action.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$ds-font",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
